---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Jutt AI Blog" description="Learn about the mission behind Jutt AI Blog and the team shaping premium AI content." url="/about">
  <Navbar />
  <main class="page-shell">
    <section class="content-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Jutt AI Blog</p>
      <h1>We publish premium AI thinking for modern operators.</h1>
      <p>Jutt AI Blog exists to make complex AI topics approachable without sacrificing depth. We blend strategy, product, design, and real-world implementation so readers can move from curiosity to action.</p>
      <p>Our mission is simple: help founders, marketers, and builders understand how artificial intelligence can create durable advantage when grounded in clarity, ethics, and disciplined execution.</p>
      <div class="highlights-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Editorial depth</h3>
          <p>Every story balances insight, examples, and clear next steps.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Practical focus</h3>
          <p>We prioritize frameworks that teams can apply immediately.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-shell { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.25rem 5rem; }
  .content-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 1.4rem; padding: 2.2rem; box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(15, 32, 67, 0.08); }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-weight: 700; }
  h1 { color: var(--text); font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.7rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; }
  .highlights-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.3rem; }
  .highlights-grid div { padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 1rem; background: #f8fbff; border: 1px solid rgba(15,32,67,0.08); }
  .highlights-grid h3 { color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .highlights-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
